      "widgets_values": [
        "DEMO: Generate an artwork title. Local Text reads a prompt and writes a short response using Qwen. Follow text to the Text / JSON Viewer; metrics reports timing. This is word generation, not a fixed-option decision.\n\n1. On local text, click ↓ only if the model is missing. Wait for installed.\n2. Press the top Run button (or ▷ on the inference node). Follow the wires to the result. ϟ only previews locally on the inference node; it does not update connected nodes.\n3. Change the prompt and Run again.\nA small model can give incorrect answers; this is an integration demo.\n\nNodes in this demo:\nꘅ Local Text · 1 · prompt and local model\nꘅ Text / JSON Viewer · Read the result\nꘅ Text / JSON Viewer · Timing and model"
